    "name": "Lucid - A Game About Dreams",
    "steam_appid": 1154690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/fbedb1ebba5b34d8eaf0930d5a135dc1.poster.avif?t=1667763011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/fbedb1ebba5b34d8eaf0930d5a135dc1.webm?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/fbedb1ebba5b34d8eaf0930d5a135dc1.mp4?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Lucid</i> is a narrative adventure game about Leif \u2013 a boring, cowardly and lonely man on a steady track towards defeat and death. A beautiful midsummer night in the tiny northern fishing village M\u00e5snes, Leif wakes up and remembers his dreams for the first time in many years. Is there a connection between his dreams and the real world?<br><br>Step into the life of Leif - the world\u2019s least impressive video game hero - who may not even have the power to step out of bed. Explore his tiny comfort zone and use lucid dreaming to reach deep into his subconscious to find a spark of life - or perhaps a final nightmarish madness.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/be05ba703167091a0a510491ba47ec92.poster.avif?t=1667763011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/be05ba703167091a0a510491ba47ec92.webm?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/be05ba703167091a0a510491ba47ec92.mp4?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>For anyone from experienced gamers to those fresh to the genre and even those new to gaming altogether - the point &amp; click adventure is a time honored genre that is both accessible and engaging.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/097123f5ff84892d860342fd5053162f.poster.avif?t=1667763011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/097123f5ff84892d860342fd5053162f.webm?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/097123f5ff84892d860342fd5053162f.mp4?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This Arctic, Nordic and S\u00e1mi story is told with dedication by a team of experienced developers from award winning games such as <i>Firewatch</i>, <i>The Longest Journey</i>, <i>Anarchy Online</i>, <i>Age of Conan</i> and <i>Trolls vs. Vikings</i> with a passion for the project. The Norwegian and S\u00e1mi team also consist of award winning script writers and one psychologist.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/fbedb1ebba5b34d8eaf0930d5a135dc1.poster.avif?t=1667763011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/fbedb1ebba5b34d8eaf0930d5a135dc1.webm?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/fbedb1ebba5b34d8eaf0930d5a135dc1.mp4?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Lucid</i> is a narrative adventure game about Leif \u2013 a boring, cowardly and lonely man on a steady track towards defeat and death. A beautiful midsummer night in the tiny northern fishing village M\u00e5snes, Leif wakes up and remembers his dreams for the first time in many years. Is there a connection between his dreams and the real world?<br><br>Step into the life of Leif - the world\u2019s least impressive video game hero - who may not even have the power to step out of bed. Explore his tiny comfort zone and use lucid dreaming to reach deep into his subconscious to find a spark of life - or perhaps a final nightmarish madness.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/be05ba703167091a0a510491ba47ec92.poster.avif?t=1667763011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/be05ba703167091a0a510491ba47ec92.webm?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/be05ba703167091a0a510491ba47ec92.mp4?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>For anyone from experienced gamers to those fresh to the genre and even those new to gaming altogether - the point &amp; click adventure is a time honored genre that is both accessible and engaging.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/097123f5ff84892d860342fd5053162f.poster.avif?t=1667763011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/097123f5ff84892d860342fd5053162f.webm?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154690/extras/097123f5ff84892d860342fd5053162f.mp4?t=1667763011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This Arctic, Nordic and S\u00e1mi story is told with dedication by a team of experienced developers from award winning games such as <i>Firewatch</i>, <i>The Longest Journey</i>, <i>Anarchy Online</i>, <i>Age of Conan</i> and <i>Trolls vs. Vikings</i> with a passion for the project. The Norwegian and S\u00e1mi team also consist of award winning script writers and one psychologist.",
    "short_description": "In a small fishing village in the land of the midnight sun, Leif\u2019s life as a cowardly, lonely and boring man is coming to an end. The only things he has to lose are the dreams he has started having at night. Can he find a spark of life in them - or a final nightmarish madness?",
